('Glasgow','Scotland','5% (net of VAT), whole stay','25 Jan 2027 (bookings made from 1 Apr 2026)','confirmed',['https://visitorlevy.scot/visitorlevy/pages/levy-scheme','https://www.glasgow.gov.uk/article/14800/Accommodation-providers'],55.864,-4.252,''),
